SUMMARY:The Accelerators live at Montclair Brewery
DESCRIPTION:The Accelerators are an all-original New Jersey-based punk band with melodic vocals and catchy hooks. Their styles range from power pop\, garage rock\, and old-school punk\, with a little dash of rockabilly thrown in. \n$5 cover charge per person that goes directly to the artists. \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
