SUMMARY:3rd Annual Montclair Mile Presented by Montclair Brewery
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a special night of racing and festivities! \nThe Montclair Mile will take place on a spectator-friendly ½ mile course that starts and finishes at Montclair Brewery. There will be mile races for runners of all ages and ability levels (and even a race for our four-legged friends!) \nAfter you’re done racing\, continue the celebration with us here at the brewery and a food truck and a diverse taplist unlike any other! This isn’t a night that you’re going to want to miss. \nRegister for the event to participate! \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
