SUMMARY:A Musical Journey Through Fire\, Air\, Water\, & Earth
DESCRIPTION:“Air moves us. Fire transforms us. Water shapes us. Earth heals us.”\nPlease join us for a musical journey through the elements: fire\, air\, water\, and earth\, at the First Congregational Church of Montclair (40 South Fullerton Avenue Montclair\, NJ)\, on Thursday\, August 6\, at 7:30pm. Singers Elizabeth Honer\, Genya Muzyczka\, Elizabeth Perryman\, along with pianist David Maiullo\, will sing a variety of musical favorites from folk songs and standards to musical theater and opera. Complimentary fans and bottled water will be provided. There will be a tasty reception with the artists following the recital. Suggested recital donation is $20.00. \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
